\pard\cbpat3\cf2\fs24 Question No: 1\~\~\~\~\~ (Marks: 1) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
Conversion of raw material into finished goods is the example of:\par
\u9658?\cf3 Industry\cf2\par
\u9658?Commerce\par
\u9658?Foreign Trade\par
\u9658?Finance\par
\ul\b Question No: 2\~\~\~\~\~ ( Marks: 1 ) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
Examples of constructive industries include:\par
\u9658? Fishery\par
\u9658? Sugar mill\par
\u9658? Plant nurseries\par
\u9658? \cf3 Canals\cf2\par
\~\par
\ul\b Question No: 3\~\~\~\~\~ (Marks: 1) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
Which of the following is excluded from factors that can affect the business?\par
\u9658?\cf3 Demographic Factors\cf2\par
\u9658?Economic and social factors\par
\u9658?Natural factors\par
\u9658?None of the above\par
