\~\par
\ul\b Question No: 24\~\~\~\~\~ (Marks: 1) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
After watching the 30-minute infomercial on Oxy-Clean, Mariah was certain the cleaning product would remove the grape juice stain from her white carpet. In terms of the communication process, Mariah has engaged in:\par
\u9658? Receiving.\par
\u9658? Messaging.\par
\u9658? Encoding.\par
\u9658? Decoding.\par
\~\par
\ul\b Question No: 25\~\~\~\~\~ (Marks; 1) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
The three major categories of influences that are believed to influence the consumer buying decision process are personal, psychological, and:\par
\u9658? Person-specific\par
\u9658? Social\par
\u9658? Demographic\par
\u9658? Situational\par
\~\par
\ul\b Question No: 26\~\~\~\~\~ (Marks; 1) - Please choose one\ulnone\b0\par
Which of the following statements is correct for a sole proprietorship?\par
\u9658? The sole proprietor has limited liability\par
\u9658? The sole proprietor can easily dispose of their ownership position relative to a shareholder in a corporation\par
